{"id":"vd-a2-the-camping-trip","level":"a2","n":18,"title":{"en":"Shall We Go Camping?","vi":"Mình đi cắm trại nhé?"},"summary":"Bố rủ Mason đi cắm trại ở hồ Pine Lake và hai bố con bàn chuyện đi khi nào, mang gì — Mason thì chẳng mặn mà lắm.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-camping-trip","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Camping Trip","vi":"Chuyến cắm trại"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"laptop","x":800}]},"cast":{"mason":{"name":{"en":"Mason","vi":"Mason"},"look":"teenboy","x":500,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#6B4A32","outfit":"tee","top":"#E9A23B","topShade":"#D18B28","collar":"#D18B28"}},"dad":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":1130,"style":{"hairColor":"#6B4A32","top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765","glasses":true}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"dad","en":"Mason, are you free next weekend?","vi":"Mason, cuối tuần sau con có rảnh không?","ipa":["ˈmeɪsən","ɑɹ","ju","fɹi","nɛkst","ˈwiˌkɛnd"],"start":0.554,"end":2.754,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.274],[2,1.437],[3,1.586],[4,1.885],[5,2.225]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"I think so. Why?","vi":"Chắc là rảnh ạ. Sao thế bố?","ipa":["aɪ","θɪŋk","soʊ","waɪ"],"start":3.544,"end":4.764,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,3.544],[1,3.58],[2,3.784],[3,4.504]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Shall we go camping? Just you and me.","vi":"Hai bố con mình đi cắm trại nhé? Chỉ bố với con thôi.","ipa":["ʃæl","wi","ɡoʊ","ˈkæmpɪŋ","dʒʌst","ju","ənd","mi"],"start":5.554,"end":8.784,"expression":"happy","gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,5.554],[1,5.778],[2,5.927],[3,6.118],[4,7.603],[5,8.011],[6,8.228],[7,8.405]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"Camping? Where?","vi":"Cắm trại ạ? Ở đâu ạ?","ipa":["ˈkæmpɪŋ","wɛɹ"],"start":9.574,"end":10.774,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,9.574],[1,10.433]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"How about Pine Lake? It's in the middle of a forest.","vi":"Hồ Pine Lake thì sao? Nó ở ngay giữa rừng.","ipa":["haʊ","əˈbaʊt","paɪn","leɪk","ɪts","ɪn","ðə","ˈmɪdəl","ʌv","ə","ˈfɔɹəst"],"start":11.564,"end":15.454,"gesture":"explain","prop":"laptop","timing":[[0,11.564],[1,11.717],[2,12.043],[3,12.328],[4,13.705],[5,13.976],[6,14.126],[7,14.262],[8,14.615],[9,14.724],[10,14.832]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"Is there Wi-Fi?","vi":"Ở đó có Wi-Fi không ạ?","ipa":["ɪz","ðɛɹ","ˈwaɪˌfaɪ"],"start":16.244,"end":17.134,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,16.244],[1,16.322],[2,16.515]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"No Wi-Fi, no phones, no TV. Just nature.","vi":"Không Wi-Fi, không điện thoại, không TV. Chỉ có thiên nhiên.","ipa":["noʊ","ˈwaɪˌfaɪ","noʊ","foʊnz","noʊ","ˈtiˈvi","dʒʌst","ˈneɪtʃɚ"],"start":17.924,"end":22.184,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.924],[1,18.09],[2,18.81],[3,18.973],[4,19.544],[5,19.748],[6,21.233],[7,21.613]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"That sounds a bit boring, Dad.","vi":"Nghe hơi chán bố ạ.","ipa":["ðæt","saʊndz","ə","bɪt","ˈbɔɹɪŋ","dæd"],"start":22.974,"end":24.314,"gesture":"shrug","timing":[[0,22.974],[1,23.068],[2,23.345],[3,23.405],[4,23.585],[5,23.994]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Boring? We can swim, go hiking and cook by the lake!","vi":"Chán á? Mình có thể bơi, đi bộ đường dài và nấu ăn bên hồ!","ipa":["ˈbɔɹɪŋ","wi","kæn","swɪm","ɡoʊ","ˈhaɪkɪŋ","ənd","kʊk","baɪ","ðə","leɪk"],"start":25.104,"end":29.514,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,25.104],[1,26.585],[2,26.816],[3,27.02],[4,27.699],[5,27.862],[6,28.487],[7,28.637],[8,28.895],[9,29.044],[10,29.18]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"OK… What shall we take?","vi":"Thôi được… Mình mang theo những gì ạ?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","wʌt","ʃæl","wi","teɪk"],"start":30.304,"end":31.744,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,30.304],[1,30.853],[2,30.973],[3,31.202],[4,31.334]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"A tent, two sleeping bags, food and a map.","vi":"Một cái lều, hai túi ngủ, đồ ăn và một tấm bản đồ.","ipa":["ə","tɛnt","tu","ˈslipɪŋ","bæɡz","fud","ənd","ə","mæp"],"start":32.534,"end":35.444,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,32.534],[1,32.594],[2,33.151],[3,33.355],[4,33.844],[5,34.388],[6,34.836],[7,34.986],[8,35.053]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"And my old compass. Your grandpa gave it to me.","vi":"Với cả chiếc la bàn cũ của bố. Ông nội tặng bố đấy.","ipa":["ənd","maɪ","oʊld","ˈkʌmpəs","jɔɹ","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","ɡeɪv","ɪt","tu","mi"],"start":35.984,"end":39.694,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,35.984],[1,36.119],[2,36.337],[3,36.636],[4,38.162],[5,38.42],[6,38.963],[7,39.167],[8,39.289],[9,39.412]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"What about the weather?","vi":"Còn thời tiết thì sao ạ?","ipa":["wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ðə","ˈwɛðɚ"],"start":40.484,"end":41.544,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,40.484],[1,40.6],[2,40.973],[3,41.093]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"I checked. It's going to be sunny all weekend.","vi":"Bố xem rồi. Cả cuối tuần trời sẽ nắng.","ipa":["aɪ","tʃɛkt","ɪts","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","bi","ˈsʌni","ɔl","ˈwiˌkɛnd"],"start":42.334,"end":46.134,"expression":"happy","gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,42.334],[1,42.466],[2,44.005],[3,44.264],[4,44.522],[5,44.63],[6,44.793],[7,45.269],[8,45.568]]},{"speaker":"mason","en":"Shall we pack a raincoat, just in case?","vi":"Mình mang theo áo mưa cho chắc nhé?","ipa":["ʃæl","wi","pæk","ə","ˈɹeɪnˌkoʊt","dʒʌst","ɪn","keɪs"],"start":46.924,"end":49.144,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,46.924],[1,47.065],[2,47.161],[3,47.402],[4,47.45],[5,48.315],[6,48.58],[7,48.7]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"A raincoat? You worry too much!","vi":"Áo mưa á? Con lo xa quá đấy!","ipa":["ə","ˈɹeɪnˌkoʊt","ju","ˈwɝi","tu","mʌtʃ"],"start":49.934,"end":52.904,"expression":"happy","react":{"mason":"confused"},"timing":[[0,49.934],[1,50.015],[2,51.691],[3,51.935],[4,52.261],[5,52.465]]}],"words":[{"id":"camping","en":"camping","ipa":"ˈkæmpɪŋ","vi":"cắm trại","level":1},{"id":"forest","en":"forest","ipa":"ˈfɔɹəst","vi":"rừng; khu rừng","level":1},{"id":"hiking","en":"hiking","ipa":"ˈhaɪkɪŋ","vi":"đi bộ đường dài; đi bộ leo núi","level":1},{"id":"nature","en":"nature","ipa":"ˈneɪtʃɚ","vi":"thiên nhiên; bản chất; tự nhiên","level":1},{"id":"weather","en":"weather","i